# "Black creature spells you cast cost {1} less" and "Whenever you cast a creature spell" are about Bontu's Monument's controller only.
# Bot1 controls it; on turn 2 Bot2 casts Dark Confidant ({1}{B}) after tapping Mox Jet and Mox Ruby. The full {1}{B} is spent (a
# discount would leave the Ruby's red mana floating) and neither life total moves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Bontu's Monument
Plains x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Dark Confidant
Plains x17

